                    </div>

                    
                    <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-6 align-self-center" id="profile-info">
                        
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-2 text-center text-lg-start">Ms. Sahar Waheed</h4>
                        
                        <h6 class="text-secondary fw-normal text-center text-lg-start" id="designation">Director</h6>

















                    

                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Sahar Waheed joined the Bank in 2006. She was appointed as Deputy CEO &amp; Chief Operating Officer in December 2024.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Sahar has 18 years of experience in banking, and she has held key positions at the Bank including Head of Strategic Planning and Change Management and most recently as the People and Change Director.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Sahar holds a BSc. in Economics and Economic History from the London School of Economics and Political Science, as well as an LLM in Commercial Law and a Chartered Banker professional qualification from the Asian Institute of Chartered Bankers.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Ms. Sahar has no shares in the Bank.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
                                                    <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 profile-card" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#member_124">
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-2">
