            <div id="custom-tabs" class="mb-5">
                <h3 class="text-black mb-4">Board Committees</h3>
                                    <div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="card-body">

        
        <div class="d-flex mb-2 flex-wrap">
            
            <h5 class="text-primary">Appointment, Nomination and Remuneration (ANR) Committee</h5>

            
            <h6 class="text-gray-500 ms-auto"><i class="far fa-users me-2"></i>5 Members</h6>
        </div>

        
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><p>The Appointment, Nomination and Remuneration Committee (ANR Committee) is established in accordance with Articles 55 and 63 of the AOA of the Bank and Part 2, Section 1.8 (b) of the CG Code issued by the CMDA. The Committee performs the functions of both a Nomination Committee and a Remuneration Committee.</p>
<p><strong>Objectives of the Committee</strong></p>
<p>The primary purpose of the ANR Committee is to assist the Board in fulfilling its responsibilities relating to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Identify and make recommendations on Board of Directors and Senior Management appointments;</li>
<li>Establish and recommend to the Board a framework of remuneration for the Bank and the specific remuneration packages of Senior Management and the CEO &amp; MD;</li>
<li>Review and recommend changes where necessary to the organizational structure of the Bank.</li>
<li>Review and place for approval succession plan of the Bank;</li>
<li>Review and place for approval necessary policies of the Bank; and</li>
<li>Review and recommend all general matters relating to Human Resources of the Bank including staff remuneration, bonus and staff health insurance to the Board.</li>
</ul></p>

        
        <h5>Members of the committee</h5>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center justify-content-md-start">
                            <div class="card shadow-none mx-3">
                    
                    <div class="card-head text-center pb-1">
                        <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/Bxop6XYv/c/vv7xtnm3-list-preview.jpg" alt="" width="120px" class="rounded-circle">
                    </div>
